{"id":4974,"date":"2026-03-05T10:37:37","date_gmt":"2026-03-05T09:37:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/venol.de\/?p=4974"},"modified":"2026-03-05T10:37:37","modified_gmt":"2026-03-05T09:37:37","slug":"advertencia-oficial-sobre-productos-venol-falsificados","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/venol.de\/es\/advertencia-oficial-sobre-productos-venol-falsificados\/","title":{"rendered":"Advertencia oficial sobre productos VENOL falsificados"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-m0ndgtjs-4dacfd81eb4e427052cdf303e6c93bf3\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-m0ndgtjs-4dacfd81eb4e427052cdf303e6c93bf3{\npadding-bottom:0;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-m0ndgtjs-4dacfd81eb4e427052cdf303e6c93bf3 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-m0ndgtjs-4dacfd81eb4e427052cdf303e6c93bf3 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-m0ndgtjs-4dacfd81eb4e427052cdf303e6c93bf3 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-m0ndgtjs-4dacfd81eb4e427052cdf303e6c93bf3 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-m0ndgtjs-4dacfd81eb4e427052cdf303e6c93bf3 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-m0ndgtjs-4dacfd81eb4e427052cdf303e6c93bf3 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-0  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >\u2757Advertencia oficial sobre productos VENOL falsificados<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-78ddib-a60b2a1d25b56d78ab936926d9ccf282\">\n#top .hr.av-78ddib-a60b2a1d25b56d78ab936926d9ccf282{\nmargin-top:0;\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-78ddib-a60b2a1d25b56d78ab936926d9ccf282 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-78ddib-a60b2a1d25b56d78ab936926d9ccf282 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-5ceqsz-c3fb0850796a309ed3cc693a6fa328de sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-5ceqsz-c3fb0850796a309ed3cc693a6fa328de av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-m0ndh2zw-e4167a071898e543a580ad593f2ff7fc '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3750\">VENOL MOTOR OIL informa sobre casos detectados de falsificaci\u00f3n de productos de la marca VENOL y distribuci\u00f3n no autorizada relacionada con <strong data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3730\">Samer Al Gaddah International General Trading Co. L.L.C.<\/strong>, con sede en Dub\u00e1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3893\">Esta entidad <strong data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3829\">no es un socio ni distribuidor autorizado de productos VENOL<\/strong> y puede intentar comercializar productos que no son originales.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"4033\">Las \u00fanicas entidades autorizadas legalmente para utilizar la marca VENOL son:<br data-start=\"3972\" data-end=\"3975\" \/>VENOL MOTOR OIL Sp. z o.o. y VENOL MOTOR OIL GmbH.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4138\">Se recomienda a clientes y distribuidores actuar con precauci\u00f3n y verificar el origen de los productos.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4140\" data-end=\"4205\">Adjuntamos la declaraci\u00f3n oficial de VENOL sobre este asunto.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-4pwcf7-6cec4ad7a8e8572bb6b19a073b81d82c av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_button  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-m0ndjbav-d7fe462dea1e389623f6532b4454b48a\">\n.avia-image-container.av-m0ndjbav-d7fe462dea1e389623f6532b4454b48a img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-m0ndjbav-d7fe462dea1e389623f6532b4454b48a .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-m0ndjbav-d7fe462dea1e389623f6532b4454b48a av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-5  avia-builder-el-no-sibling '   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image-4975 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-4975 avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/warning-news-3.png\" alt='' title='warning-news'  height=\"661\" width=\"1024\"  itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" srcset=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/warning-news-3.png 1024w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/warning-news-3-300x194.png 300w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/warning-news-3-768x496.png 768w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/warning-news-3-705x455.png 705w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --><div  class='avia-button-wrap av-32mn5f-715bde10b8e9d8f6fe205324a103ec90-wrap avia-button-left  avia-builder-el-6  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last '>\n<